  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">City Climate Finance Gap Fund MultiDonor Trust Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Trust Fund is to help cities in middle-income and low-income countries transition towards low-carbon and climate-resilient pathways in line with global efforts to limit temperature increase to 1.5 degrees above pre-industrial levels.</narrative>
  </description>
